<title>USA: Panaco to acquire Amoco properties.</title>
<headline>Panaco to acquire Amoco properties.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Panaco Inc said Tuesday it has entered an agreement with Amoco Corp's Amoco Porduction Co to purchase Amoco's interests in 16 offshore blocks in the Gulf of Mexico.</p>
<p>The purchase price is $42.7 million in cash and two million shares of Panaco's common stock, Panaco said.  </p>
<p>Amoco's working interest ownership in the seven fields involved ranges from 12 percent to 55 percent and has an estimated net equivalent proven reserves of 57 billion cubic feet, Panaco said.</p>
<p>Probable and provable reserves add an additional 48 billion cubic feet, the company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
